#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Client configuration"
msgstr "3. 客户端配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "**app/desktop**, **app/mobile**, and **browser Web** are remote clients; they **do not read** Hub `config.yaml` token.\n"
msgstr "**app/desktop**、**app/mobile** 与 **浏览器 Web**（`web.enabled` + Tunnel 或局域网 `:2659`）为远程客户端；它们**不读取** Hub `config.yaml` 中的 token。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:122
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Client      | Storage                                          |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| app/desktop | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json` (`hub` section) |\n"
"| app/mobile  | Capacitor Preferences                            |\n"
"| Browser Web | localStorage (settings page)                     |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 客户端      | 存储                                      |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| app/desktop | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json`（`hub` 段） |\n"
"| app/mobile  | Capacitor Preferences                        |\n"
"| Browser Web | localStorage（设置页）                 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:124
msgid "Settings (all clients):"
msgstr "设置（所有客户端）："

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
msgid ""
"**Hub URL** — e.g. `https://anima.example.com` or `http://192.168.1.10:2658` "
"(Hub root, **without** `/web`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
msgid "**Hub API Token** — `fa_at_...` from `anima token create`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:129
msgid ""
"Browser Web: `/web/config.json` sets default Hub to the page origin; first "
"visit still requires saving token in settings."
msgstr ""
"浏览器 Web：`/config.json` 可建议默认 Hub（`tunnel.hostname`）；首次访问仍须"
"在设置中保存 token。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:131
msgid ""
"Flow: open Hub settings → fill → **Test connection** → Save. Desktop "
