#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Authentication behavior"
msgstr "4. 认证行为"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:134
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"REST:  Authorization: Bearer fa_at_<prefix>_<secret>\n"
"SAP:   WebSocket /sap/v1 → connect frame includes auth_token\n"
"MCP:   POST/GET /mcp → Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"
msgstr ""
"REST:  Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"
"SAP:   WebSocket /sap/v1 → connect frame includes auth_token\n"
"MCP:   POST/GET /mcp → Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:141
msgid ""
"`/web/*` static assets skip service auth; `/api` and `/mcp` require Bearer "
"token."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:143
msgid "Missing or invalid token → HTTP `401` or SAP connection closed."
msgstr "缺少或错误的 token → HTTP `401` 或 SAP 连接关闭。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. MCP outbound (external agents query Hub data)"
msgstr "5. MCP 出站（外部 Agent 查询 Hub 数据）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:147
msgid ""
"Hub serves Streamable HTTP MCP Server at **`/mcp`**, exposing read-only "
"tools from ToolSets with `expose_mcp: true` (e.g. `memory_recall`, "
"`conversation_search`). External MCP clients (Cursor, Claude Desktop, etc.) "
"connect **without LLM relay**."
msgstr ""
"Hub 在 **`/mcp`** 提供 Streamable HTTP MCP Server，暴露 `expose_mcp: true` "
"的 ToolSet 中的只读工具（如 `memory_recall`、`conversation_search`）。外部 "
"MCP 客户端（Cursor、Claude Desktop 等）**无需 LLM relay** 即可连接。"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:148
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# External agent example (Cursor mcp.json, etc.)\n"
"mcpServers:\n"
"  freeanima:\n"
"    url: http://127.0.0.1:2658/mcp\n"
"    headers:\n"
"      Authorization: \"Bearer fa_at_...\"\n"
msgstr ""
"# External agent example (Cursor mcp.json, etc.)\n"
"mcpServers:\n"
"  freeanima:\n"
"    url: http://127.0.0.1:2658/mcp\n"
"    headers:\n"
"      Authorization: \"Bearer <remote_auth.token>\"\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:159
msgid ""
"**Inbound** (Hub connects to external MCP servers): `config.yaml` "
"`mcp_servers` (`capabilities/mcp-client`)"
msgstr ""
"**入站**（Hub 连接外部 MCP 服务器）：`config.yaml` `mcp_servers`"
"（`capabilities/mcp-client`）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:159
msgid ""
"**Outbound** (external agents call Hub tools): `/mcp` endpoint "
"(`capabilities/mcp-server`)"
msgstr ""
"**出站**（外部 Agent 调用 Hub 工具）：`/mcp` 端点（`capabilities/mcp-"
"server`）"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operations"
msgstr "运维"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:169
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command                          | Description                                    |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `anima token create/list/revoke` | Service API Token 管理（CLI，直连 PG）         |\n"
"| `anima tunnel status`            | Tunnel / cloudflared status                    |\n"
"| `anima tunnel start` / `stop`    | Manual cloudflared (production: service stack) |\n"
"| `anima web start --foreground`   | Standalone Web static server (debug, `/web`)   |\n"
"| `anima service status`           | Hub / Tunnel stack                             |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 命令                        | 说明                                       |\n"
"| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `anima tunnel status`          | Tunnel / cloudflared 状态                       |\n"
"| `anima tunnel start` / `stop`  | 手动 cloudflared（生产环境：service 栈）    |\n"
"| `anima web start --foreground` | 独立 Web 静态服务器（调试）              |\n"
"| `anima service status`         | Hub / Web / Tunnel 栈                          |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:180
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                | Check                                                               |\n"
"| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Public 502             | Is Hub running? `anima service status`                              |\n"
"| Public 1033            | `anima tunnel status` shows `connected: no`                         |\n"
"| 401                    | Client token valid; run `anima token list --subject-id <id>`        |\n"
"| Local OK, remote fails | Remote requests need Bearer / SAP auth_token                        |\n"
"| CORS error in browser  | Add UI origin to `http.cors_origins`, or use Hub `/web` same-origin |\n"
"| 401 after token change | Update client settings; revoke old tokens if needed                 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 现象                         | 检查                                                      |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 公网 502                      | Hub 是否在运行？`anima service status`                     |\n"
"| 公网 1033                     | `anima tunnel status` 显示 `connected: no`                |\n"
"| 401                             | 客户端 token 是否与 `remote_auth.token` 一致                   |\n"
"| 本地正常、远程失败          | 远程请求需 Bearer / SAP auth_token；公网 Host 需 token |\n"
"| 更换 token 后 401        | 更新 Hub 配置**并**所有客户端设置页        |\n"

